@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Editor
participant ":System" as System

activate Editor


Editor -> System : asks to create a scenario
activate System
System --> Editor : requests scenario name, period (start and end date) and initialBudget
deactivate System


Editor -> System : provides name, start, end date and initialBudget
activate System
System --> Editor : show options and asks to select one
deactivate System
alt locomotive
Editor -> System: select locomotive types to include in the scenario
activate System
System --> Editor: shows all available locomotion types
deactivate System
Editor -> System: defines available types
activate System
System --> Editor : success
deactivate System

else production rate
Editor -> System: select production rates to include in the scenario
activate System
System --> Editor: shows list
deactivate System
Editor -> System: select industry and define production rate
activate System
loop for each industry
System --> Editor: success
deactivate System
else mixed behavior
Editor -> System: selects mixed behavior
activate System
System --> Editor: show options menu (import/export/transform)
deactivate System
Editor -> System: selects behavior
activate System
System --> Editor: success
deactivate System
end
end
Editor -> System: asks to see selected data
activate System
System --> Editor : shows all data and requests confirmation
deactivate System

Editor -> System : confirms data
activate System

System --> Editor : displays operation success
deactivate System
deactivate Editor

@enduml
